# Water Tribe Rallier: "Waterbend {5}: ..." Bot2's Anointed Peacekeeper names it, so the ability costs {2} more (CR 601.2f
# by way of 602.2b). Tapping artifacts and creatures pays only the generic mana of the waterbend cost, never the tax
# (CR 701.67b). On turn 3 Bot1 has one Island and six untapped creatures: seven in all, but only five of them may pay, and
# the activation is refused for want of mana. On turn 5, with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet too, the Island and the Pearl pay
# the tax and five creatures the waterbend, and the Jet and the Savannah Lions stay untapped.

